# Midnight Club 3: DUB Edition (54540079), Nova, FIRST RUN: no MC3 profile
# on the disk. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not played.
#
# Evidence: titlebench hands-off 240 s (0-0-y-1790416268-titlebench-19,
# Nova), one frame per ~10 s in frames/: f02 Rockstar logo, f04-f09 intro
# FMV, f10 legal screen, f12-f17 "PRESS START TO BEGIN" (~120-170 s), then
# the FMV again (f18-f24). Nothing past the title is on disk.
#
# The route aims at ARCADE -> CRUISE [guess, recalled]: free driving in the
# city with no timer and no objective, so the window holds only driving.
# Career starts with cutscenes and a car pick, and would be the fallback.
wait 60
shot boot60
press START                 # [guess] try to skip the intro FMV
wait 30
shot boot90
wait 25
shot boot115                # expect "PRESS START TO BEGIN" [seen f12]
mark booted
press START
wait 8
shot after-title            # OPEN: a profile screen (create new) or a storage prompt
press A                     # [guess] create new profile
wait 6
shot keyboard               # [guess] a name keyboard
press START                 # [guess] START accepts a keyboard in many titles; else move to Done
wait 6
shot after-keyboard
press A                     # [guess] confirm / save
wait 8
shot saved
mark profile-saved
shot main-menu              # [guess] Career highlighted, Arcade below it
axis LY max                 # [guess] down: Arcade
wait 0.15
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
shot on-arcade
press A
wait 6
shot arcade-menu            # [guess] Cruise first
press A
wait 6
shot city
press A                     # [guess] first city (San Diego)
wait 6
shot car
press A                     # [guess] first car
wait 6
shot confirm
press A
wait 30
shot loading
wait 10
shot drive
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame driving with the HUD
repeat forever {
    axis RT max
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 4
}
